## Third-party fonts

This plugin bundles and downloads **no font files**. It only names font families
that are expected to already be installed on the user's machine, so their
licensing is between the user and the font's authors:

- **Estedad** — Copyright (c) 2020 Amin Abedi (fontamin.com).
  SIL Open Font License 1.1. https://github.com/aminabedi68/Estedad
- **Vazirmatn** — Copyright 2015 The Vazirmatn Project Authors.
  SIL Open Font License 1.1. https://github.com/rastikerdar/vazirmatn

Neither font is redistributed here. If you later ship either font's binaries
with this plugin, that is permitted under the OFL 1.1 provided you include the
OFL license text and preserve the Reserved Font Name terms.
